{"id": "0e4105e2-43bb-440e-8158-3e64163c78c0", "slug": "webgl-scene-editor-skeuomorphic-2d", "title": "WebGL Scene Editor - Skeuomorphic 2D", "description": "Webgl Scene Background Effect is designed for delivering a visual treatment or immersive background effect. Key features include atmospheric visuals, motion depth, and flexible presentation layering. It is suitable for visual-first pages, motion studies, and atmospheric hero treatments.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"WebGL Scene Editor - Skeuomorphic 2D\"\ndescription: \"Webgl Scene Background Effect is designed for delivering a visual treatment or immersive background effect. Key features include atmospheric visuals, motion depth, and flexible presentation layering. It is suitable for visual-first pages, motion studies, and atmospheric hero treatments.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#00E5FF\"\n  secondary: \"#000000\"\n  accent: \"#004455\"\n  background: \"#050608\"\n  surface: \"#1A1C23\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#2A2D35\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# WebGL Scene Editor - Skeuomorphic 2D\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Aksonvady Phomhome (@aksonvady). Views: 5; favorites: 4; remixes: 0.\nTags: background, animated, webgl, threejs, dither, effect.\n## Overview\nWebgl Scene Background Effect is designed for delivering a visual treatment or immersive background effect. Key features include atmospheric visuals, motion depth, and flexible presentation layering. It is suitable for visual-first pages, motion studies, and atmospheric hero treatments.\n\nWORKSPACE / SCENE.01 2D CANVAS 3D RENDER NODE GRAPH WEBGL ACTIVE HIERARCHY Main Camera Point Light Volumetric Mesh Post Process RES: 1920x1080 FPS: 60.0 INSPECTOR Transform X 0.00 Y 1.42 Z -0.5 Shader Variables Emission…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: WORKSPACE / SCENE.01.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #00E5FF, secondary #000000, accent #004455, background #050608, surface #1A1C23, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>WebGL Scene Editor - Skeuomorphic 2D</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#050608] text-gray-300 w-screen h-screen overflow-hidden selection:bg-[#00e5ff] selection:text-black font-sans antialiased relative\">\n\n    <!-- WebGL Background: Dither + Laser Smoke -->\n    <canvas id=\"bg-canvas\" class=\"fixed inset-0 w-full h-full z-0 pointer-events-none opacity-90\"></canvas>\n\n    <!-- Structural Framed Grid System Background -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none flex flex-col justify-between opacity-30\" style=\"background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(0,229,255,0.015) 0, rgba(0,229,255,0.015) 1px, transparent 1px, transparent 12px);\">\n        <!-- Container Lines & Intersections -->\n        <div class=\"absolute left-[20%] top-0 bottom-0 w-[1px] bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent via-[#00e5ff] to-transparent opacity-30\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute right-[25%] top-0 bottom-0 w-[1px] bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent via-[#00e5ff] to-transparent opacity-30\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute top-[60px] left-0 right-0 h-[1px] bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-[#2a303c] to-transparent\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-[180px] left-0 right-0 h-[1px] bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-[#2a303c] to-transparent\"></div>\n\n        <!-- Intersection Mini Squares -->\n        <div class=\"absolute left-[20%] top-[60px] w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-[#00e5ff] -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 opacity-50\" style=\"box-shadow: 0 0 8px #00e5ff;\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute right-[25%] top-[60px] w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-[#00e5ff] -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 opacity-50\" style=\"box-shadow: 0 0 8px #00e5ff;\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute left-[20%] bottom-[180px] w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-[#00e5ff] -translate-x-1/2 translate-y-1/2 opacity-50\" style=\"box-shadow: 0 0 8px #00e5ff;\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute right-[25%] bottom-[180px] w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-[#00e5ff] -translate-x-1/2 translate-y-1/2 opacity-50\" style=\"box-shadow: 0 0 8px #00e5ff;\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Main Layout Container -->\n    <div id=\"app-root\" class=\"relative z-10 w-full h-full flex flex-col p-2 md:p-4 gap-4 opacity-0\">\n\n        <!-- Header Frame -->\n        <header class=\"h-[52px] w-full shrink-0 flex items-center justify-between px-4 rounded-lg border border-[#ffffff08]\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(30,34,43,0.6) 0%, rgba(15,17,21,0.8) 100%); box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.05), inset 0 -1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.5), 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.4); backdrop-filter: blur(8px);\">\n            <!-- Left Branding -->\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n                <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-md flex items-center justify-center border border-[#1a1c23]\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, #2a2d35 0%, #1a1c23 100%); box-shadow: inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.1), 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:box-minimalistic-linear\" width=\"18\" class=\"text-[#00e5ff]\"></iconify-icon>\n                </div>\n                <h1 class=\"text-sm font-medium tracking-tight text-white flex items-center gap-2\">\n                    WORKSPACE <span class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 font-normal\">/</span> <span class=\"text-[#00e5ff]\">SCENE.01</span>\n                </h1>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Center View Modes -->\n            <div class=\"hidden md:flex p-1 rounded-md border border-[#111]\" style=\"background: #0d0f14; box-shadow: inset 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);\">\n                <button class=\"px-4 py-1 text-xs font-semibold rounded text-[#00e5ff] border border-[#00e5ff]/20\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(0,229,255,0.1) 0%, transparent 100%); box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0,229,255,0.1);\">2D CANVAS</button>\n                <button class=\"px-4 py-1 text-xs font-medium rounded text-gray-500 hover:text-gray-300 transition-colors\">3D RENDER</button>\n                <button class=\"px-4 py-1 text-xs font-medium rounded text-gray-500 hover:text-gray-300 transition-colors\">NODE GRAPH</button>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Right Controls -->\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-[#222]\" style=\"background: #111; box-shadow: inset 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);\">\n                    <div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#00e5ff] animate-pulse\" style=\"box-shadow: 0 0 6px #00e5ff;\"></div>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs tracking-widest text-gray-400\">WEBGL ACTIVE</span>\n                </div>\n                <button class=\"w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center rounded-md border border-[#ffffff08] hover:border-[#00e5ff]/40 transition-colors\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, #2a2d35 0%, #1a1c23 100%); box-shadow: inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.05), 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:settings-linear\" width=\"16\" class=\"text-gray-400\"></iconify-icon>\n                </button>\n            </div>\n        </header>\n\n        <!-- Main Workspace Area -->\n        <div class=\"flex-1 w-full flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4 overflow-hidden\">\n\n            <!-- Left Panel: Scene Graph -->\n            <aside class=\"w-full md:w-[20%] flex flex-col rounded-lg border border-[#ffffff08] relative\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(22,25,31,0.8) 0%, rgba(12,14,18,0.9) 100%); box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.05), inset 0 -1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.5), 0 8px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.6); backdrop-filter: blur(8px);\">\n                <!-- Frame Brackets -->\n                <svg class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-4 h-4 text-gray-600 -translate-x-[1px] -translate-y-[1px]\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"square\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" d=\"M4 12V4h8\"></path></svg>\n                <svg class=\"absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-4 h-4 text-gray-600 translate-x-[1px] translate-y-[1px]\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"square\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" d=\"M20 12v8h-8\"></path></svg>\n\n                <div class=\"px-4 py-3 border-b border-[#ffffff05] flex items-center justify-between\">\n                    <span class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-gray-400\">HIERARCHY</span>\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:layers-minimalistic-linear\" width=\"14\" class=\"text-gray-500\"></iconify-icon>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"flex-1 p-2 overflow-y-auto\" style=\"scrollbar-width: none;\">\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\">\n                        <!-- Hierarchy Item Skeuo -->\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 px-2 py-1.5 rounded bg-[#0a0c10] border border-[#00e5ff]/30 text-[#00e5ff]\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.8), 0 0 8px rgba(0,229,255,0.1);\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:camera-linear\" width=\"14\"></iconify-icon>\n                            <span class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-tight\">Main Camera</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <!-- Indented Items -->\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1 pl-4 relative\">\n                            <div class=\"absolute left-2 top-0 bottom-0 w-[1px] bg-gray-800\"></div>\n\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 px-2 py-1.5 rounded hover:bg-[#1a1c23] transition-colors cursor-pointer group\">\n                                <div class=\"w-2 h-[1px] bg-gray-700 absolute left-2\"></div>\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:lightbulb-minimalistic-linear\" width=\"14\" class=\"text-gray-500 group-hover:text-gray-300\"></iconify-icon>\n                                <span class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-tight text-gray-400 group-hover:text-gray-200\">Point Light</span>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 px-2 py-1.5 rounded hover:bg-[#1a1c23] transition-colors cursor-pointer group\">\n                                <div class=\"w-2 h-[1px] bg-gray-700 absolute left-2\"></div>\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:box-linear\" width=\"14\" class=\"text-gray-500 group-hover:text-gray-300\"></iconify-icon>\n                                <span class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-tight text-gray-400 group-hover:text-gray-200\">Volumetric Mesh</span>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 px-2 py-1.5 rounded hover:bg-[#1a1c23] transition-colors cursor-pointer group\">\n                                <div class=\"w-2 h-[1px] bg-gray-700 absolute left-2\"></div>\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:magic-stick-3-linear\" width=\"14\" class=\"text-gray-500 group-hover:text-gray-300\"></iconify-icon>\n                                <span class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-tight text-gray-400 group-hover:text-gray-200\">Post Process</span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </aside>\n\n            <!-- Center Viewport (Transparent to reveal WebGL) -->\n            <main class=\"flex-1 relative flex flex-col rounded-lg border border-[#ffffff10] overflow-hidden\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 0 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.5), 0 8px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);\">\n                <!-- Viewport Inner Frame / Ruler Marks -->\n                <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 h-4 flex justify-around items-end opacity-20 pointer-events-none\">\n                    <div class=\"w-[1px] h-2 bg-white\"></div><div class=\"w-[1px] h-1 bg-white\"></div><div class=\"w-[1px] h-3 bg-white\"></div><div class=\"w-[1px] h-1 bg-white\"></div><div class=\"w-[1px] h-2 bg-white\"></div><div class=\"w-[1px] h-1 bg-white\"></div><div class=\"w-[1px] h-3 bg-white\"></div><div class=\"w-[1px] h-1 bg-white\"></div><div class=\"w-[1px] h-2 bg-white\"></div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 h-4 flex justify-around items-start opacity-20 pointer-events-none\">\n                    <div class=\"w-[1px] h-2 bg-white\"></div><div class=\"w-[1px] h-1 bg-white\"></div><div class=\"w-[1px] h-3 bg-white\"></div><div class=\"w-[1px] h-1 bg-white\"></div><div class=\"w-[1px] h-2 bg-white\"></div><div class=\"w-[1px] h-1 bg-white\"></div><div class=\"w-[1px] h-3 bg-white\"></div><div class=\"w-[1px] h-1 bg-white\"></div><div class=\"w-[1px] h-2 bg-white\"></div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Floating Viewport Tools (Skeuomorphic) -->\n                <div class=\"absolute top-4 right-4 flex flex-col gap-2 z-10\">\n                    <button class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded border border-gray-700/80 flex items-center justify-center hover:border-[#00e5ff]/50 transition-colors\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, #2a2d35 0%, #1a1c23 100%); box-shadow: inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.1), 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:maximize-square-minimalistic-linear\" width=\"16\" class=\"text-gray-300\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </button>\n                    <button class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded border border-gray-700/80 flex items-center justify-center hover:border-[#00e5ff]/50 transition-colors\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, #2a2d35 0%, #1a1c23 100%); box-shadow: inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.1), 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:refresh-linear\" width=\"16\" class=\"text-gray-300\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"absolute top-4 left-4 flex gap-2 z-10 p-1 rounded-md border border-[#111]\" style=\"background: #0d0f14; box-shadow: inset 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);\">\n                    <button class=\"w-6 h-6 flex items-center justify-center rounded bg-[#1a1c23] border border-[#00e5ff]/30 text-[#00e5ff]\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:cursor-square-linear\" width=\"14\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </button>\n                    <button class=\"w-6 h-6 flex items-center justify-center rounded text-gray-500 hover:text-gray-300\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:move-linear\" width=\"14\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </button>\n                    <button class=\"w-6 h-6 flex items-center justify-center rounded text-gray-500 hover:text-gray-300\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:round-transfer-linear\" width=\"14\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Center Crosshair Target -->\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 m-auto w-12 h-12 pointer-events-none opacity-40\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-0 bottom-0 left-1/2 w-[1px] bg-[#00e5ff] -translate-x-1/2\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute left-0 right-0 top-1/2 h-[1px] bg-[#00e5ff] -translate-y-1/2\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 border border-[#00e5ff] rounded-full scale-50\"></div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Bottom Status -->\n                <div class=\"absolute bottom-4 left-4 text-[10px] font-mono text-gray-500 tracking-wider\">\n                    RES: 1920x1080 <br> FPS: <span class=\"text-[#00e5ff]\">60.0</span>\n                </div>\n            </main>\n\n            <!-- Right Panel: Inspector -->\n            <aside class=\"w-full md:w-[25%] flex flex-col rounded-lg border border-[#ffffff08] relative\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(22,25,31,0.8) 0%, rgba(12,14,18,0.9) 100%); box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.05), inset 0 -1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.5), 0 8px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.6); backdrop-filter: blur(8px);\">\n                <!-- Frame Brackets -->\n                <svg class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-4 h-4 text-gray-600 translate-x-[1px] -translate-y-[1px]\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"square\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" d=\"M20 12V4h-8\"></path></svg>\n                <svg class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-4 h-4 text-gray-600 -translate-x-[1px] translate-y-[1px]\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"square\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" d=\"M4 12v8h8\"></path></svg>\n\n                <div class=\"px-4 py-3 border-b border-[#ffffff05] flex items-center justify-between\">\n                    <span class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-gray-400\">INSPECTOR</span>\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:slider-vertical-minimalistic-linear\" width=\"14\" class=\"text-gray-500\"></iconify-icon>\n                </div>\n\n                <div id=\"prop-scroll\" class=\"flex-1 p-4 overflow-y-auto flex flex-col gap-6\" style=\"scrollbar-width: none;\">\n\n                    <!-- Section: Transform -->\n                    <div class=\"prop-row flex flex-col gap-3\">\n                        <span class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-gray-500 font-semibold border-b border-gray-800 pb-1\">Transform</span>\n\n                        <!-- Skeuomorphic Vector3 Input -->\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-2\">\n                            <div class=\"flex-1 flex flex-col gap-1\">\n                                <span class=\"text-[9px] text-gray-500 text-center\">X</span>\n                                <div class=\"h-7 rounded border border-[#222] flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-mono text-gray-300\" style=\"background: #0a0b0e; box-shadow: inset 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);\">0.00</div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"flex-1 flex flex-col gap-1\">\n                                <span class=\"text-[9px] text-gray-500 text-center\">Y</span>\n                                <div class=\"h-7 rounded border border-[#222] flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-mono text-[#00e5ff]\" style=\"background: #0a0b0e; box-shadow: inset 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.8), inset 0 0 5px rgba(0,229,255,0.1);\">1.42</div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"flex-1 flex flex-col gap-1\">\n                                <span class=\"text-[9px] text-gray-500 text-center\">Z</span>\n                                <div class=\"h-7 rounded border border-[#222] flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-mono text-gray-300\" style=\"background: #0a0b0e; box-shadow: inset 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);\">-0.5</div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Section: Material Properties -->\n                    <div class=\"prop-row flex flex-col gap-4\">\n                        <span class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-gray-500 font-semibold border-b border-gray-800 pb-1\">Shader Variables</span>\n\n                        <!-- Skeuomorphic Toggle -->\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n                            <span class=\"text-xs text-gray-400\">Emission Active</span>\n                            <div class=\"w-10 h-5 rounded-full relative p-[2px] cursor-pointer\" style=\"background: #0a0b0e; box-shadow: inset 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.8), inset 0 -1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.05);\">\n                                <div class=\"absolute left-[2px] top-[2px] bottom-[2px] w-1/2 rounded-full bg-[#00e5ff] transition-all translate-x-full\" style=\"box-shadow: 0 0 8px #00e5ff, inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.4);\"></div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Skeuomorphic Slider 1 -->\n                        <div class=\"w-full flex flex-col gap-2 mt-2\">\n                            <div class=\"flex justify-between text-[10px] text-gray-400\">\n                                <span>Density</span>\n                                <span class=\"text-[#00e5ff] font-mono\">0.85</span>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"w-full h-2 rounded-full relative\" style=\"background: #0a0b0e; box-shadow: inset 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.9), inset 0 -1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.05);\">\n                                <!-- Track -->\n                                <div class=\"absolute left-0 top-0 bottom-0 w-[85%] rounded-full\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(90deg, #004455, #00e5ff); box-shadow: 0 0 5px rgba(0,229,255,0.3);\"></div>\n                                <!-- Handle -->\n                                <div class=\"absolute left-[85%] top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-4 h-4 rounded-full border border-gray-900 cursor-ew-resize\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, #4a4d55 0%, #2a2d35 100%); box-shadow: inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.3), 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);\">\n                                    <div class=\"w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-[#00e5ff] m-auto mt-[5px]\" style=\"box-shadow: 0 0 4px #00e5ff;\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Skeuomorphic Slider 2 -->\n                        <div class=\"w-full flex flex-col gap-2 mt-2\">\n                            <div class=\"flex justify-between text-[10px] text-gray-400\">\n                                <span>Scatter</span>\n                                <span class=\"font-mono text-gray-300\">0.24</span>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"w-full h-2 rounded-full relative\" style=\"background: #0a0b0e; box-shadow: inset 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.9), inset 0 -1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.05);\">\n                                <!-- Track -->\n                                <div class=\"absolute left-0 top-0 bottom-0 w-[24%] rounded-full\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(90deg, #222, #555);\"></div>\n                                <!-- Handle -->\n                                <div class=\"absolute left-[24%] top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-4 h-4 rounded-full border border-gray-900 cursor-ew-resize\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, #4a4d55 0%, #2a2d35 100%); box-shadow: inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.3), 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);\">\n                                    <div class=\"w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-gray-500 m-auto mt-[5px]\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Skeuomorphic Big Button -->\n                    <div class=\"prop-row mt-4\">\n                        <button class=\"w-full h-10 rounded-md border border-[#111] relative overflow-hidden group\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, #2a2d35 0%, #16181d 100%); box-shadow: inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.1), 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);\">\n                            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(0,229,255,0.1) 0%, transparent 100%);\"></div>\n                            <span class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-[#00e5ff] relative z-10 drop-shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(0,229,255,0.5)]\">COMPILE SHADER</span>\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n\n                </div>\n            </aside>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Bottom Timeline Area -->\n        <footer class=\"h-[120px] w-full shrink-0 rounded-lg border border-[#ffffff08] flex flex-col relative overflow-hidden\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(22,25,31,0.8) 0%, rgba(12,14,18,0.9) 100%); box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.05), inset 0 -1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.5), 0 8px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.6); backdrop-filter: blur(8px);\">\n            <!-- Top control bar -->\n            <div class=\"h-10 border-b border-[#ffffff05] flex items-center px-4 justify-between bg-[#111318]/50\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n                    <!-- Playback Controls Skeuomorphic -->\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1\">\n                        <button class=\"w-7 h-7 flex items-center justify-center rounded border border-[#111]\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, #2a2d35 0%, #1a1c23 100%); box-shadow: inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.1), 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:skip-previous-bold\" width=\"12\" class=\"text-gray-400\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center rounded border border-[#111]\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, #2a2d35 0%, #1a1c23 100%); box-shadow: inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.1), 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:play-bold\" width=\"14\" class=\"text-[#00e5ff] drop-shadow-[0_0_5px_rgba(0,229,255,0.5)]\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"w-7 h-7 flex items-center justify-center rounded border border-[#111]\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, #2a2d35 0%, #1a1c23 100%); box-shadow: inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.1), 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:skip-next-bold\" width=\"12\" class=\"text-gray-400\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"w-[1px] h-4 bg-gray-700\"></div>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs font-mono text-gray-400\">00:01:24:12</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex gap-2\">\n                    <span class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-gray-600 font-semibold\">Keyframes</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Timeline Track Area -->\n            <div class=\"flex-1 relative bg-[#0a0c10] p-4 flex flex-col gap-2\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);\">\n                <!-- Playhead -->\n                <div class=\"absolute top-0 bottom-0 left-[30%] w-[1px] bg-[#00e5ff] z-10\" style=\"box-shadow: 0 0 5px #00e5ff;\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-2 h-2 bg-[#00e5ff]\"></div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Track 1 -->\n                <div class=\"w-full h-4 rounded bg-[#111318] flex items-center relative border border-[#222]\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute left-[15%] w-2 h-2 rotate-45 bg-gray-500 border border-gray-900\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute left-[30%] w-2 h-2 rotate-45 bg-[#00e5ff] border border-gray-900\" style=\"box-shadow: 0 0 5px #00e5ff;\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute left-[60%] w-2 h-2 rotate-45 bg-gray-500 border border-gray-900\"></div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Track 2 -->\n                <div class=\"w-full h-4 rounded bg-[#111318] flex items-center relative border border-[#222]\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute left-[20%] w-2 h-2 rotate-45 bg-gray-500 border border-gray-900\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute left-[45%] w-2 h-2 rotate-45 bg-gray-500 border border-gray-900\"></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </footer>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- WebGL & GSAP Logic -->\n    <script>\n        // --- WebGL Background: Laser + Dither Skill ---\n        const canvas = document.getElementById('bg-canvas');\n        const gl = canvas.getContext('webgl');\n\n        if (gl) {\n            const resize = () => {\n                canvas.width = window.innerWidth;\n                canvas.height = window.innerHeight;\n                gl.viewport(0, 0, canvas.width, canvas.height);\n            };\n            window.addEventListener('resize', resize);\n            resize();\n\n            const vsSource = `\n                attribute vec2 position;\n                void main() { gl_Position = vec4(position, 0.0, 1.0); }\n            `;\n\n            const fsSource = `\n                precision highp float;\n                uniform vec2 u_resolution;\n                uniform float u_time;\n\n                // Simple pseudo-random & noise\n                float hash(vec2 p) {\n                    return fract(sin(dot(p, vec2(12.9898, 78.233))) * 43758.5453);\n                }\n                float noise(vec2 p) {\n                    vec2 i = floor(p); vec2 f = fract(p);\n                    vec2 u = f * f * (3.0 - 2.0 * f);\n                    return mix(mix(hash(i + vec2(0.0,0.0)), hash(i + vec2(1.0,0.0)), u.x),\n                               mix(hash(i + vec2(0.0,1.0)), hash(i + vec2(1.0,1.0)), u.x), u.y);\n                }\n\n                // FBM for Volumetric Smoke\n                float fbm(vec2 p) {\n                    float v = 0.0; float a = 0.5;\n                    mat2 rot = mat2(cos(0.5), sin(0.5), -sin(0.5), cos(0.5));\n                    for (int i = 0; i < 5; ++i) {\n                        v += a * noise(p); p = rot * p * 2.0 + vec2(100.0); a *= 0.5;\n                    }\n                    return v;\n                }\n\n                void main() {\n                    vec2 uv = gl_FragCoord.xy / u_resolution.xy;\n                    vec2 p = uv * 2.0 - 1.0;\n                    p.x *= u_resolution.x / u_resolution.y;\n\n                    // Theme Color: Cyan\n                    vec3 accent = vec3(0.0, 0.9, 1.0);\n\n                    // 1. Vertical Laser Beam\n                    float distX = abs(p.x);\n                    float core = smoothstep(0.003, 0.0, distX);\n                    float pulse = sin(u_time * 3.0) * 0.5 + 0.5;\n                    float glow = 0.015 / (distX + 0.005);\n                    vec3 laserColor = mix(accent * 0.6, vec3(1.0), core) * (core + glow * (0.7 + 0.3 * pulse));\n\n                    // 2. Smoky Fog constrained to center\n                    vec2 q = vec2(fbm(p + u_time * 0.1), fbm(p + vec2(1.0)));\n                    vec2 r = vec2(fbm(p + q + u_time * 0.15), fbm(p + q + vec2(8.3, 2.8)));\n                    float fog = fbm(p + r);\n                    float smokeMask = smoothstep(1.2, 0.0, distX); // falloff\n                    vec3 smokeColor = mix(vec3(0.0), accent * 0.4, fog * fog) * smokeMask;\n\n                    // Combine Scene\n                    vec3 sceneColor = laserColor + smokeColor;\n\n                    // 3. Large Pixel Dither Pass (Bayer Matrix)\n                    float pixelScale = 5.0;\n                    vec2 scaledCoord = gl_FragCoord.xy / pixelScale;\n                    int x = int(mod(scaledCoord.x, 4.0));\n                    int y = int(mod(scaledCoord.y, 4.0));\n\n                    // 4x4 Bayer extraction\n                    float bayer = 0.0;\n                    if(x==0&&y==0) bayer=0.0/16.0; else if(x==1&&y==0) bayer=8.0/16.0; else if(x==2&&y==0) bayer=2.0/16.0; else if(x==3&&y==0) bayer=10.0/16.0;\n                    else if(x==0&&y==1) bayer=12.0/16.0; else if(x==1&&y==1) bayer=4.0/16.0; else if(x==2&&y==1) bayer=14.0/16.0; else if(x==3&&y==1) bayer=6.0/16.0;\n                    else if(x==0&&y==2) bayer=3.0/16.0; else if(x==1&&y==2) bayer=11.0/16.0; else if(x==2&&y==2) bayer=1.0/16.0; else if(x==3&&y==2) bayer=9.0/16.0;\n                    else if(x==0&&y==3) bayer=15.0/16.0; else if(x==1&&y==3) bayer=7.0/16.0; else if(x==2&&y==3) bayer=13.0/16.0; else if(x==3&&y==3) bayer=5.0/16.0;\n\n                    // Quantize with Restrained Palette\n                    float luma = dot(sceneColor, vec3(0.299, 0.587, 0.114));\n                    luma += (bayer - 0.5) * 0.5; // Apply dither noise\n\n                    vec3 outColor;\n                    if (luma < 0.15) outColor = vec3(0.02, 0.025, 0.03); // Deep Background\n                    else if (luma < 0.35) outColor = vec3(0.06, 0.08, 0.1); // Charcoal Mist\n                    else if (luma < 0.7) outColor = accent * 0.5; // Cyan Haze\n                    else outColor = vec3(0.9, 1.0, 1.0); // Bright Core Core\n\n                    // Vignette to hide edges\n                    float vignette = smoothstep(1.5, 0.5, length(p));\n                    gl_FragColor = vec4(outColor * vignette, 1.0);\n                }\n            `;\n\n            const compile = (type, src) => {\n                const s = gl.createShader(type);\n                gl.shaderSource(s, src);\n                gl.compileShader(s);\n                return s;\n            };\n\n            const prog = gl.createProgram();\n            gl.attachShader(prog, compile(gl.VERTEX_SHADER, vsSource));\n            gl.attachShader(prog, compile(gl.FRAGMENT_SHADER, fsSource));\n            gl.linkProgram(prog);\n            gl.useProgram(prog);\n\n            const buffer = gl.createBuffer();\n            gl.bindBuffer(gl.ARRAY_BUFFER, buffer);\n            gl.bufferData(gl.ARRAY_BUFFER, new Float32Array([-1,-1, 1,-1, -1,1, 1,1]), gl.STATIC_DRAW);\n\n            const pos = gl.getAttribLocation(prog, 'position');\n            gl.enableVertexAttribArray(pos);\n            gl.vertexAttribPointer(pos, 2, gl.FLOAT, false, 0, 0);\n\n            const uRes = gl.getUniformLocation(prog, 'u_resolution');\n            const uTime = gl.getUniformLocation(prog, 'u_time');\n\n            const start = Date.now();\n            const render = () => {\n                gl.uniform2f(uRes, canvas.width, canvas.height);\n                gl.uniform1f(uTime, (Date.now() - start) / 1000.0);\n                gl.drawArrays(gl.TRIANGLE_STRIP, 0, 4);\n                requestAnimationFrame(render);\n            };\n            render();\n        }\n\n        // --- GSAP Animation & ScrollTrigger Logic ---\n        document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", () => {\n            gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n            // Initial Build Animation\n            const tl = gsap.timeline();\n            tl.to(\"#app-root\", { opacity: 1, duration: 0.1 });\n\n            // Stagger main structural panels\n            tl.from(\"header\", { y: -20, opacity: 0, duration: 0.6, ease: \"power3.out\" })\n              .from(\"aside, main\", { y: 20, opacity: 0, duration: 0.6, stagger: 0.1, ease: \"power3.out\" }, \"-=0.4\")\n              .from(\"footer\", { y: 20, opacity: 0, duration: 0.6, ease: \"power3.out\" }, \"-=0.4\");\n\n            // ScrollTrigger for Inspector Rows\n            gsap.utils.toArray('.prop-row').forEach(row => {\n                gsap.from(row, {\n                    scrollTrigger: {\n                        trigger: row,\n                        scroller: \"#prop-scroll\",\n                        start: \"top 95%\",\n                    },\n                    y: 10,\n                    opacity: 0,\n                    duration: 0.4,\n                    ease: \"power2.out\"\n                });\n            });\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "webgl-scene-editor-skeuomorphic-2d.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s-v3/webgl-scene-editor-skeuomorphic-2d.jpg", "source_name": "webgl-scene-editor-skeuomorphic-2d-DESIGN.md", "views": 94, "forks": 1, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "2e815afb-cac1-4c01-90e1-cf3810246e35", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T23:42:42.900529+00:00"}